ms/v1/","context":{"app_id":1993410,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-1993410-1846651706691329","game_id":"steam-1993410","kind":"announcement","title":"Laws of Nadragia demo is in Next Fest!","summary":"I'm finally taking part in Steam Next Fest with my game, Laws of Nadragia, as I prepare for its release next year! You can only participate in Next Fest once, so I'm really nervous >","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691329","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1993410-1836506165572752","game_id":"steam-1993410","kind":"update","title":"Development Update – Getting Closer to Release","summary":"I've finally decided to write a development update about how things are going with my detective prosecutor simulator set in the totalitarian medieval state of Nadragia. First, I'd like to talk about the game's core features - the things I've spent so much time working on - and then move on to the development process and the current results.The Core Features of Laws of Nadragia:Real-time search for contradictionsUnlike other courtroom games, Laws of Nadragia never highlights suspicious statements","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-04T17:21:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165572752","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1993410-1813674389046909","game_id":"steam-1993410","kind":"announcement","title":"DEVELOPMENT NEWS","summary":"We are finishing the last animation of the 2nd game day (yes, yes - only the second, because it introduces many new characters and mechanics used in the rest of the game). All the other content of the 2nd game day - courts, dialogues, character abilities, animations, etc. - is ready.,I'm preparing for a closed test on day 2 among my friends: I need to find if it's too difficult to solve court cases or too easy, and whether it's interesting at all.,Also, I'm finishing up the court cases of the 3r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-19T21:20:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1813674389046909","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1993410-1802354289599098","game_id":"steam-1993410","kind":"announcement","title":"A new dynamic trailer!","summary":"The Supreme Collegium is proud to present a new dynamic trailer for The Laws of Nadragia!In the first trailer, we tried to introduce people to our characters. In the new second trailer, we've used a more dynamic approach to what's happening and shown some new interfaces and animations of the characters that will be in the game.Write in the comments, did you like it? We are eager to know your opinion! ːsteamhappyː","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-13T15:26:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1802354289599098","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1993410-1792751526149062","game_id":"steam-1993410","kind":"update","title":"Major update of the demo version: Voice acting, animations, bugs","summary":"Dear ladies and gentlemen, members of the Supreme Collegium! I have amazing news for you: The Laws of Nadragia will have partial character voiceover! Yes-yes, you heard it right: Each character now has a large set of lines and emotions to accompany his speech. For this, 9 different speakers in Russian and English were involved in order to show the character and mood of the characters as amazingly and authentically as possible. The voice acting has been going on in parallel with the development o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-03T20:04:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1792751526149062","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1993410-5747233970418212905","game_id":"steam-1993410","kind":"update","title":"Demo-version update!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43798255/834727bb68863ed022e17f15e245ca3b3bb0d840.gif I've updated the demo on Steam. Finally, the plugin that printed the text has been fixed, and the demo version has been updated. If you're interested, please play it, and if you find any bugs, let me know! Although, if you've already played the demo, you don't need to play it again - there are no new cases in it. Here are the changes: The portraits of the characters have been enlarged during the dialogue outside the courtro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-05-16T11:13:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5747233970418212905","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1993410-5519792046251759820","game_id":"steam-1993410","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo is Out NOW!","summary":"Ladies and Gentlemen, colleagues, members of the Supreme Collegium of Nadragia! On this fateful day, we are pleased to present to your eyes a demo version of the Laws of Nadragia, a game about Aiden Fair, who was forced to become a prosecutor. Will Aiden be able to survive at his post? What tricks will he use to achieve a quota of guilty verdicts? It is for you to decide! Important information before starting your work: According to the best Nadragian analysts, it may take you 1~2 hours to compl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-01-26T11:57:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5519792046251759820","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1993410-6300039510123274078","game_id":"steam-1993410","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is releasing on January 26th!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43798255/ce80d34bdc3745d4ce687f752b42e922007f8045.jpg Ladies and gentlemen, members of the Supreme Collegium! We are gathered here today to celebrate this momentous event. Thousands of hours of work by the staff of the development bureau were not in vain: on January 26th, a demo version of the laws of Nadragia will appear before you! Let's say loudly: three cheers! In the demo version, you can start your journey for a simple bastard - Aiden Fair, who received the non-repudiabl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-01-12T12:35:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6300039510123274078","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1993410-5124584686264776657","game_id":"steam-1993410","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo is coming!","summary":"Good day, prosecutor! We are glad to inform you that the work on the demo is in full swing. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43798255/5a89f7c94370f313e71d9690627f8f16e7369fad.gif At this moment our best artist is finishing animated images creation. According to our data, there are still 5 animated characters left with several animations each. Our animator is spending a lot of time scrupulously drawing each frame, pixel by pixel. We are also glad to inform you, prosecutor, that the dialogues and story for the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2023-08-01T16:22:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5124584686264776657","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-1993410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:38Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:37Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-1993410":"2026-10-25T23:59:38Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"1993410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"2713180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:38Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-1993410","app_id":1993410,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"8a0ba7855fa803f4cc471cbf3121d798a4b48eaea06ef4e2afa05da93922abc2","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"전체주의 국가 나드라지아에서 검사로 활동하세요. 법과 사실을 이용해 범죄자들을 유죄로 만들어야 합니다... 하지만 양심을 지킬 수 있을까요?","publishers":[{"name":"Fuzzy Pixel Game Studio","creator_clan_account_id":43910517}],"developers":[{"name":"Fuzzy Pixel Game Studio","creator_clan_account_id":43910517}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1806476400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Laws Of Nadragia Second Trailer ENGLISH","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1749554190","trailer_category":3,"micr